<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round results in the $2.3 million Italian Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat 4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 6-3 6-2  </p>
<p>Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) beat 11-Alberto Costa (Spain) 6-4 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat 15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>10-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat 8-Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 4-6 7-5 6-4  </p>
<p>6-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat 12-Boris Becker (Germany) 7-6 (9-7) 6-3  </p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Davide Scala (Italy) 7-5 6-2  </p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 3-6 6-2 7-5</p>
</text>
